WEBVTT

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:00.270
Everyone, as you are already aware, in Star Century Zero-One Sixty-Five,

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.280
162 years ago now,

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:05.750
at the same time that our Global Union was formed,

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.280
the Galactic Organization of Trade and Tariffs,

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:12.620
or GOTT, was also inaugurated. At first, it was located on Earth,

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.620
and its primary role was...

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:17.620
No, it's my pleasure.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:20.630
...and promote the settlement of agreements and contracts between the governments...

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:23.960
What? GOTT has children like that working for them?

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:28.300
That one looks like an elementary school student, doesn't she?

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.800
I think that there was someone

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.930
among my younger brother Charles' girlfriends that she looks like.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.220
All right, guys, shoot the clay pigeon!

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:09.840
Ah! My night-vision mode!

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:54.250
Y- yow... Turn off my pain sensors!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.920
W- what is this?

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.260
What's going on?

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:59.380
Ta-da~a!!

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:04.930
Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the main office of the GOTT!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.440
Did you enjoy our welcoming attraction,

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:12.130
the crime prevention drill "Defend Everybody, GOTT!"?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.610
We certainly did raise quite a commotion.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.740
Thank you very much for your cooperation.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:28.720
Y- you don't mean... that just now couldn't have been just an attraction!

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.900
Y- you're kidding, right?

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:39.670
I sincerely apologize if we startled you.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.240
However, there is no need for concern.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.770
Here at GOTT, in order to protect the inherent properties and equal rights

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.580
of everyone who lives in the galaxy,

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:52.910
we find these sorts of daily "drills" to be indispensable.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.580
It's time for E-Shift, right?

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.680
I'm terribly sorry,

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:01.480
but someone else will have to take care of you from here on.

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.930
Is there something troubling you?

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.020
Uh... no...

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.900
We appreciate your efforts. The chief is waiting for you.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:51.240
I understand you just finished quite a job down there.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.240
It wasn't even enough to burn off one of those cookies you serve with tea.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:57.580
Oh, that's right! Some nice Chironian tea just came in!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.480
When you've finished your special duty,

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.250
I'll share some with you as a little reward.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.580
You're dangling something in front of us, which means?

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:07.590
I'm just saying "Come back alive."

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:11.590
Thanks for always making our jobs worth doing, Mer.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:15.600
Lu, I'll have some nice grape juice ready for you.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:17.430
Thank you very much.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.100
Come on in.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:33.980
Welcome, Lumiere. Come in, Éclair.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:37.940
Was your reception booth work overly boring?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:50.900
Faunus? That money-grubbing corporate planet?

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:51.900
No.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:55.070
Then, was it Medeia that came crying?

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:59.240
Complaining that Faunus was exploiting them unfairly, or something?

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:03.580
No. Neither side has filed suit.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:09.580
This time, the Global Union will be your client.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:12.250
You're going to be our client!?

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:18.260
No, the government of the Global Union is going to be GOTT's.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:20.990
In short, you're ordering us to mediate the intense friction

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:25.270
between two governments before war breaks out, right?

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:30.600
Yes. Please deliver Auditor Armbrust to Planet Medeia safely.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.630
Right. Huh!?

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:35.970
Letter of attorney?

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:41.820
Arbitration provisions, signed by the President of Faunus.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.720
A bill, acknowledging the transfer of authority to the parliament.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.320
A letter of attorney for Global Union ambassadors.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.890
Among various other things.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:51.590
All together, by means of this 182 page letter of attorney,

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:55.560
I currently act on behalf of the government of Faunus.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.900
Faunus must really be messed up.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.900
In any case, it is our duty now to deliver him safely to Medeia,

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:05.910
and ensure that the arbitrations are successful. That's our job.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:09.180
Which means that the trouble we had in the lobby earlier

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.910
might have something to do with this, huh?

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.250
Maybe it had to do with that thing that happened last time.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:19.250
Or it might unexpectedly have something to do with that one thing next week.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.250
Huh? You're kidding!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.590
I'm joking. According to probability theory,

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:27.090
it's valid to think that it had to do with the duties

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.600
held by some other member. Those cyborgs...

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:32.800
...had bodies that were constructed from a jumble of parts,

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.530
but the spectral analysis of their packing gel...

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.870
...matches that used by a secret Medeia military outfit.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.810
Huh? Medeian?

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.210
There's also the possibility

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.210
that a faction from Faunus set them up in disguise...

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.880
Enough. The truth is still a mystery, right?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.080
After all,

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:55.150
we only have to deliver this man to the prime minister of Planet Medeia.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.560
That is correct. If you would be so kind as to escort me, ladies...

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:04.230
Hey! I'm always telling you, don't do stuff like that, right!? Geez!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.570
Oh, is that right?

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:06.570
That's right!

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:14.910
2045343, S-2 Cruiser La Muse, please go runway to linear shaft No. 5.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.970
Thank you.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.920
It's not too congested today, huh?

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.080
I wish it was always like this.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.090
What!?

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.200
Take this, you miserable GOTT dogs!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.540
Wirbelwind! I'm engaging the inertial drive,

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.530
and making an emergency separation from the linear field!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.840
Dammit!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.560
You dummies.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.390
Any inertial systems in the area surrounding a ship

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:07.890
using inertial drive become all distorted.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.900
That was a close call, huh?

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.920
Now then, let's ring the bell and get going!

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.240
How lacking in grace...

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:24.370
Damn it all!

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.320
Altering planned course and breaking free

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.290
of Aineias' gravity field at autonomous acceleration.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.830
Éclair and Lumiere have departed safely.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:54.970
Come back soon. You mustn't die again, either one of you...

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.220
Citizens of the galaxy, have a look at this!

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:15.230
This is the magnificent sight of the Faunus space fleet!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.230
It is rare to hold a naval review across other star systems,

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:22.240
but this is the first step the corporate planet Faunus is taking,

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.600
in order to guard the Warp Gate, the main artery of the galaxy.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.810
So they say, but the military is monopolizing it, right?

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:32.910
It's the Medeians I feel sorry for.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:35.520
It's just a polite way of saying they're holding an economic blockade.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.920
With them holding the Warp Gate,

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.250
there'll be no food or anything else reaching those guys.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:43.590
Be careful about what you say! After all, we work for them.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:44.580
Right, right...

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:49.260
We still cannot determine who is the culprit

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.600
in yesterday's bombing of the air circulation system,

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.930
and each of the local public organizations are at their limits disbursing provisions.

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:59.610
There is uneasiness spreading among the population as well, Prime Minister.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.610
And the arbitrator for the Faunusian Parliament?

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:03.810
Still nothing.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.750
It appears that they are being obstructed by the military forces.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:22.630
Hmph. It seems that our operatives on Aineias have failed.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:26.270
So? As long as we keep things up here,

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:29.300
the special envoy for mediation will not be arriving on Medeia.

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:33.910
If we were to land actual forces on Medeia, things would go faster,

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.580
without us having to go through this.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:39.750
If it tarnishes corporate Faunus' planned image,

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:42.580
then nothing can come of it, Admiral.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:45.640
You're going to run in the next presidential election, right?

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:47.950
What?

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:55.600
It's a powerful Canceller! Unable to locate and home in on it in time!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.530
D- don't panic!

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.610
It's GOTT! They're trying to make contact with us!

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:09.610
This shouldn't be happening...

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:12.580
As long as they can't pass through the Warp Gate...

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.610
Can they warp all on their own!?

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.620
What are you doing!?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:22.290
Shoot them down! Sink them! Blast any ship that gets near Medeia!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.920
What was that!?

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:32.900
Is Admiral Van, commander of Planet Faunus' 8th Fleet, in there?

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.330
This is the GOTT,

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.130
of " Let's all keep up the good of the galaxy together!" fame.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:55.920
Ta-da~a!

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.590
We're here to deliver your pizza!

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.260
Yow!

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.930
That hurts, you know...

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.260
W- who the hell are you!?

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.630
Pardon us, Admiral.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.270
We are from the Galactic Organization of Trade and Tariffs,

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:14.270
or GOTT, ES members Lumiere and...

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:17.940
...Éclair. It's nice to meet you, Admiral.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:21.610
ES members! The ones I heard so much about?

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.950
As it happens, and in accordance with the Union Charter,

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:27.690
we must go to Planet Medeia

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:31.290
in order to mediate an interstellar contract with your government.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:35.560
Which is why, for the mutual benefit of both Faunus and Medeia,

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:39.830
could we please ask you to escort us to Medeia?

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:45.240
As you can see, we have our Certificate of Arbitration,

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.570
Letter of Attorney, our own identification...

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.910
Huh?

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.970
Well, it's for times like this that we keep another copy...

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:03.350
Can we take this then to be an unconditional action?

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.260
Obliterate them, and their high-speed ship!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.360
Having people turn up missing in the middle of a dispute

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.760
is something that happens a lot!

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.370
The MPU is down.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.940
Electrical systems on the bridge are completely nonfunctional!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.640
Use your Solbright guns!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:36.550
Only pretty flowers are allowed to have thorns!

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:52.340
Under our authority as GOTT ES members,

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.800
we charge you with being interstellar criminals.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:00.400
Chief, request authorization to execute an arrest.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:07.920
Approved, Lumiere and Éclair. I'll leave the rest up to you.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.650
Yes, Ma'am.

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:30.930
W- we're finished! With the ES members here, we're finished!

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.880
Ha! This is starting to get interesting!

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:42.320
We have done what we had to do. Shall we bring this to a close now?

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.630
As I might have expected of the fleet flagship,

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:57.570
they weren't even up to the task of being our playmates!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.970
That's because you went in there challenging them

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:01.570
dressed as a pizza delivery person.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:04.580
It looks like you enjoyed yourself quite a bit.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.250
You left me all by myself, and I became lonesome.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.920
You're the one who said you couldn't leave that bag behind.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:15.690
Due to outages on the main bridge, transferring command functions...

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:20.060
- You've finally picked them up on sensors!? That took too long! ...to the sub-bridge has top priority.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.260
Repeating...

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.930
Get a 4-dimensional autolock on the target with the tactical computer!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:27.400
Main batteries, don't you dare miss them!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.370
Fire!!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:35.540
The tactical computer is out of our control!

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.700
What!?

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.450
Earlier, when the MPU went down,

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.550
I think the ship's mainframe may also have been affected!

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:47.520
Have every ship in the fleet do a physical shutdown

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:49.560
of their integrated information systems immediately!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.390
Have all units annihilate the target ship!

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:02.570
Each of the fleet's mainframes have already been compromised!

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:04.730
Cease fire!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:17.250
Thanks. Don't worry, Wirbelwind. Still...

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:22.240
controlling the whole fleet was a bit rough, all right.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:26.260
Minus 30° to critical temperature.

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:29.600
Lumiere, if you could match up the timing...

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:33.100
Understood, just don't talk to me too much.

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:35.590
I'm in the middle of concentrating right now...

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.550
What? What's going on?

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.220
The entire fleet is completely out of control!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:56.750
We're done for! Everything is done for!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:03.890
This can't be happening!

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:16.670
There, all done.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:22.950
By piling them into Warpspace like that without creating an exit...

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.920
are you just " putting a lid on something foul"?

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:29.590
Could you instead call it "putting birds in a cage" for me?

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:34.150
It's the same thing either way, right? Here, the "key to the cage door."

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.420
We girls should be elegant.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:05.890
President, that you yourself should come...

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.560
President? Of Faunus!?

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.900
I thought that was kind of big to be a document case.

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:17.570
What a marvelous honor! A new page in history is about to be opened.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.540
In the over three centuries it has been since mankind first

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:20.570
earnestly began carving out a history in space...

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:24.910
Armbrust, just how many other people's pockets does this put you in now?

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.910
Don't be ridiculous. I'm just a minor official for the Global Union.

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:33.850
That's the official line, right? You grown-ups are all dirty!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:39.430
The Global Union supports GOTT as they defend the benefits and rights

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.530
of everyone that lives in the galaxy.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:44.050
How about we put an end to this discussion?

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:56.210
So, Planet Faunus' president was able to put their shady military in check,

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:58.880
as well as improve the image of their corporate planet,

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:02.550
which means his win in the next election is secure.

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:03.720
You know what's more?

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:08.220
GOTT was given an unofficial apology from the prime minister of Planet Medeia.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:11.390
They said there was a high possibility that those battle cyborgs from earlier

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:13.890
were tied to someone on Medeia.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:16.830
It might have been a faction that is stirred up,

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.230
thinking that GOTT was conspiring with Faunus.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:21.230
This tea is too bitter!

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:23.240
Huh? It's bitter?

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:28.910
I'm just a child, so I don't understand "adult tastes" very well.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:32.500
You don't have to understand them. Two more hours until E-Shift.

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:09.490
<i>Light and shadow, right and wrong...</i>

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:13.530
<i>for every phenomenon that exists,
there is another form,</i>

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:15.860
<i>one that always opposes it.</i>

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:19.560
<i>Next time on Kiddy Grade</i>
